  "ocaml" {>= "4.08.0"}
  "ocamlfind"
]
conflicts: [
  "zarith"
]
synopsis: "Zarith without the conf-gmp hop — builds directly against the system GMP"
description: """
Canary-local package: zarith built WITHOUT the conf-gmp virtual package
(the conf-free prototype — doc/canary/project/conf_survey.md). The build
runs zarith's own ./configure, which probes GMP via pkg-config — the
same check conf-gmp performs — so the system GMP dependency is real but
not declared through opam's conf layer. Same findlib name (zarith), so
it conflicts with the stock package; scenarios pin-switch between them
(the z3 stable/dev store-pin dance, algorithm_explainer.md §10).
"""
